@bank all
// Pillar 5 (head writer, seat W): Step 2 texts (seats M1, M2). TEXTS unless marked. Keys in keys-p5.md.

// ---- M1 rounds (24a)
== round.title
- Morning round, Deck {deck}
== round.mark.fine
- Fine
== round.mark.worn
- Worn
== round.mark.off
- Something's off
== round.okay
- Looks all right to me.
== round.found
- Found by you: {machine}.
== round.done
- Round done. Anything worn is on the board, found by you.
== round.pick
- Pick five to look at today.
== round.nose
- You've got a nose for it.

// ---- M4 hauling (24d)
== haul.title
- Manifest run: {n} crates
== haul.manifest
- Manifest
== haul.crate.laundry
- Linen
== haul.crate.infirmary
- Medical supplies
== haul.crate.store
- Crew store stock
== haul.crate.galley
- Dry goods
== haul.crate.bridge
- Bridge spares
== haul.stop.laundry
- the laundry, Deck 4
== haul.stop.infirmary
- the infirmary, Deck 3
== haul.stop.store
- the crew store, Deck 3
== haul.stop.galley
- the galley, Deck 3
== haul.stop.bridge
- the bridge, Deck 1
== haul.load
- Load the cart
== haul.drop
- Drop it off
== haul.done
- Manifest done. Every crate where it belongs.
== haul.order
- Which stop next?
== haul.goodroute.note
- a good route
== stock.title
- Stocktake
== stock.look
- Shelf checked. All in order.
== stock.wrong
- A {part} on the {shelf} shelf? That's not where it lives.
== stock.move
- Move it
== stock.moved
- Back on its own shelf. A job won't go looking for it now.

// ---- M3 the drill and the inspection (24c)
== drill.kind.fire
- Fire drill
== drill.kind.pressure
- Pressure drill
== drill.kind.power
- Power drill
== drill.cal
- Drill at 15:00: {drill}
== drill.toast
- Drill in ten minutes. Muster at the Works bay.
== drill.job.fire
- Take the extinguisher. Stand by the hatch.
== drill.job.pressure
- Close and dog the bulkhead door. Stand by.
== drill.job.power
- Stand by the breaker cabinet. Switch the junior wing to reserve at the call.
== drill.allclear
- All clear. Drill over.
== drill.offduty
- Day off: muster by the lift with the off-duty crew.
== inspect.bed.button
- Make the bed
== inspect.locker.button
- Tidy up
== inspect.bed.done
- Bed made. Corners and all.
== inspect.locker.done
- Locker tidy. Nothing loose.
== inspect.reminder
- Inspection at 06:30: clean uniform, bed made, locker tidy.
== inspect.mail.subject
- This morning's inspection

// ---- M5 tuning (24e)
== tune.title
- Tune: {machine}
== tune.minus
- −
== tune.plus
- +
== tune.hot
- running hot
== tune.warm
- a little hot
== tune.steady
- steady
== tune.cool
- a little cool
== tune.cold
- cold
== tune.done
- Settled.

// ---- M6 incidents (24f)
== inc.card.burst
- ! Burst pipe, {room}
== inc.card.lift
- ! The lift is stuck
== inc.card.alarm
- ! Galley alarm
== inc.toast.burst
- Burst pipe on Deck {deck}. Make it safe.
== inc.toast.lift
- The lift's stuck between decks. Someone's inside.
== inc.toast.alarm
- The galley alarm's going. Smoke in the kitchen.
== inc.step.safe
- Make it safe
== inc.step.clean
- Clean up
== inc.step.fix
- Fix the cause
== inc.wrong.valve
- Still running. That one's downstream.
== inc.safe.burst
- Valve closed. The water's stopped.
== inc.safe.lift
- Brake released. The car's moving.
== inc.safe.alarm
- Alarm reset. Quiet at last.
== inc.clean.burst
- Mopped. Dry enough to walk on.
== inc.clean.lift
- Out safe. Nobody hurt.
== inc.clean.alarm
- Vents open. The air's clearing.
== inc.done
- Safe, clean, fixed.
== inc.missed
- The crew dealt with it. You'll hear about it at dinner.

// ---- M2 your work uniform (24b)
== uniform.rule
- Your uniform: change after oily jobs.
== uniform.grubby
- Your uniform's grubby. Change at your wardrobe.
== uniform.wait
- While you wait: service {machine}

// ---- Playtest 2 (item 1, head writer W2): the first round is a job on the board; the goal arrow and these green
// tips walk you round, one per stop (seats E1 and U). Tips, 200 characters at most; {machine} the machine's name.
== tip.round.take
- Your first round is on the job board. Take it, and follow the arrow.
== tip.round.go
- Walk to {machine}. Follow the arrow.
== tip.round.look
- Look at {machine}. Listen to it. Tap Look.
== tip.round.mark
- Mark it: fine, worn, or something's off. Trust your eyes.
== tip.round.next
- Next one. Follow the arrow.
== tip.round.done
- Round done. Turn it in at the job board.
